            <div xml:id="d561">

                <pb facs="0718" n="594" sameAs="frus:frus1921v01/pg594"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77/2156: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Japan</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-07-16T11:00:00+09:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 16,
                                1921—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received July 16—4:54
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>248. The following from Peking: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“260. July 16, 11 a.m. Your 192, July 11, 5 p.m. Cooperation promised by
                            Minister of Communication[s], bond issue abandoned for the present.
                            Despatch follows.<anchor n="16" xml:id="d561-f1"/> Stevens
                            informed.”</p></quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
